//   Street), T5 a flat jog onto the back straight (the same corridor, in the shade of the 160 Imlay and Christie's warehouses), T6
//   left and the long T7 right hairpin at Pioneer Street, the Clinton Wharf straight west (T8 kink), T9 90-degree left into the
