// container terminal platform of nyc/nyport rises to quay level: ramps at <= 3 % and walls down to the ground), kerbs, white lines,
// run-off, concrete walls with catch fences, the pit lane with temporary garages against the Pier 11 shed, team stands on the pit
// wall, five grandstands, the start gantry (lights follow the race), marshal posts, light pylons lit at night. Inside the walls:
// app street trees removed, the port's yard stacks / masts / gates / parked chassis / trucks on crossing routes hidden (window.NyPort),
